SDL-E1047 (spec/table.md)

  x invalid view body: the view's query comes first — write `select …;` before any clauses
   ,----
 1 | table view stats { permissions: full; select author from post; };
   :                  |
   :                  `-- the view's block starts with its query
   `----
  help: a view's block is its query — write `table view <name> {{ select …; }};`, with any clauses after the query
